double_wire_text_matrix|add_double|0|0.0001|Ok|fixed at exponent -4
double_wire_text_matrix|add_double|0|0.00001|Ok|scientific at exponent -5
double_wire_text_matrix|add_double|0|0.0000001|Ok|the 1e-7 threshold case
double_wire_text_matrix|add_double|0|100000000000000|Ok|fixed at exponent 14
double_wire_text_matrix|add_double|0|1000000000000000|Ok|fixed at exponent 15 (net48 R: 1E+15)
double_wire_text_matrix|add_double|0|123456789.456|Ok|many digits fixed
double_wire_text_matrix|add_double|0|1E+300|Ok|large magnitude
double_wire_text_matrix|add_double|0|-1.5E-300|Ok|small negative magnitude
double_wire_text_matrix|add_double|0|42|Ok|integral double has no decimal point
double_wire_text_matrix|add_double|0|0|Ok|zero
double_wire_text_matrix|add_double|0|1500000000000000|Ok|two digits fixed at exponent 15 (net48 R: 1.5E+15)
double_wire_text_matrix|add_double|0|12345678901234568|Ok|seventeen significant digits at exponent 16
double_wire_text_matrix|add_double|0|10000000000000000|Ok|fixed at exponent 16 (net48 R: 1E+16)
double_wire_text_matrix|add_double|0|9.999999999999998E+16|Ok|largest fixed band value, trailing zero padding
double_wire_text_matrix|add_double|0|1E+17|Ok|scientific at exponent 17
double_wire_text_matrix|add_double|0|123456789012345680|Ok|seventeen digits at exponent 17
double_wire_text_matrix|add_double|0|1234567890123456.8|Ok|seventeen digits with a fraction in the band
double_wire_text_matrix|add_double|0|0.30000000000000004|Ok|seventeen significant digits below one
double_wire_text_matrix|add_double|0|0.3333333333333333|Ok|sixteen significant digits (net48 R: 17)
double_wire_text_matrix|add_double|0|0.00012345678901234567|Ok|seventeen digits fixed at exponent -4
double_wire_text_matrix|stop
